  NameToDisplay: Castor
  PortraitTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: f464fefe809192d4cad6dbf3ca58d5de, type: 3}
  DialogueLine: 'Ah, of course! It is quite simple, really! All you have to do is
    point! Clicking on an object or person will allow you to interact with them.
    For example, if you use your mouse to click on a person, you will begin talking
    to that person! If you want to move locations, simply click on a hallway entrance,
    and you will move to the next room! Easy peasy! If you have any further questions
    or need a reminder, you can always check the instructions in the pause menu! '
